E0201 [Error] 896..897 expected an expression after `..`
    label this range has no endpoint
    note a range needs at least one endpoint: `a..b`, `a..` or `..b`. A bare `..` is not an expression — to name a whole string or list, use the value itself rather than slicing it ([gram.expr.primary]).
